# Accepted findings. Every line needs: who accepted it, why, and when to re-check.
# Format:
# CVE-2099-0000  # nirav, 2026-10-16: no fix upstream yet; re-check 2026-11-16

# --- IaC ---
# S3 tfstate bucket uses SSE-S3 (AES256), not a customer-managed KMS key.
# A CMK costs ~$1/month + API calls; SSE-S3 + versioning + public-access-block is enough here.
AWS-0132  # nirav, 2026-10-16: SSE-S3 accepted for tfstate bucket; re-check if Stage 2 adds KMS
